# A settings sheet let go of: Station → the test station → "…" → 重命名, a new name typed, the scrim tapped; the sheet
# goes down on the sheet's spring, only drawn: 保存 tapped where it is drawn as it goes renames nothing.
timeout 90000
until 端到端测试
tap icon:settings
until =Station
tap =Station
until =studio
tap =studio
until 在此 station 上
tap icon:more
until 重命名
tap 重命名
until station 名称
clear
type e2e-not-{T}
shot 1-asked
tapxy 195 60
# (60 ms into the sheet's going down: 保存 tapped where it is only drawn)
wait 60
now shot 2-sinking
now tapxy -60 -330
now tapxy -60 -300
now tapxy -60 -270
now tapxy -60 -240
gone station 名称
until =studio
shot 3-gone
log do: peer station-name studio
# (the command beside the run reads still.fail cloud)
wait 3000
